    "topic": "Alarm when all ALB targets are unhealthy",
    "stem": "<p>A CloudOps engineer is managing a web application that runs on Amazon EC2 instances behind an Application Load Balancer (ALB). The instances run in an EC2 Auto Scaling group. The CloudOps engineer wants to set an alarm for when all target instances associated with the ALB are unhealthy.</p>\n<p>Which condition should be used with the alarm?</p>",
