    "stem": "<p>A CloudOps engineer needs to automate the invocation of an AWS Lambda function. The Lambda function must run at the end of each day to generate a report on data that is stored in an Amazon S3 bucket.</p>\n<p>What is the MOST operationally efficient solution that meets these requirements?</p>",
