    "stem": "<p>A company is hosting backend web services across Amazon EC2 Linux instances in public subnets in a VPC. A CloudOps engineer tries to connect to the instance by using SSH but is unable to connect.</p>\n<p>What could be the cause of the failed connection?</p>",
