    "stem": "<p>A company has a web application that runs on Amazon EC2 instances in an Auto Scaling group. The company stores the application logs in the /var/log/application directory on each instance. A CloudOps engineer must configure an automated solution to send logs to Amazon CloudWatch Logs.</p>\n<p>Which solution will meet this requirement with the LEAST operational overhead?</p>",
