    "topic": "CloudFormation S3 bucket, random name, encrypted",
    "stem": "<p>A CloudOps engineer needs to create an Amazon S3 bucket as a resource in an AWS CloudFormation template. The bucket name must be randomly generated, and the bucket must be encrypted. Other resources in the template will reference the bucket.</p>\n<p>Which CloudFormation resource definition should the CloudOps engineer use to meet these requirements?</p>",
