    "n": 69,
    "topic": "Matching 1/4: protect data at rest",
    "stem": "<p>A company uses Amazon SageMaker AI to build ML applications. The applications must meet the company's data privacy, infrastructure security, and compliance goals.</p>\n<p>Which AWS service is correct for the following objective?</p>\n<p><strong>Protect data at rest</strong></p>",
